 "title": "Pharaoh's Lost Dog Tablet",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🐕",
 "sentences": [
  "An ancient dog got a royal stone tablet!",
  "George A. Reisner found it in October 1935.",
  "The white limestone measures 54.2 by 28.2 by 23.2 cm.",
  "It lists gifts donated for his funeral by an unknown pharaoh.",
  "The inscription contains 10 vertical rows of carved hieroglyphs.",
  "He was a sighthound with erect ears and a curly tail.",
  "The tablet was later recycled into a mastaba structure."
 ],
